---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const effectiveDate = 'June 15, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Sunbeam Consulting"
  description="How Sunbeam Consulting handles data and privacy on this website."
>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-10">Effective {effectiveDate}</p>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-lg">
          This policy explains what information Sunbeam Consulting collects when you
          visit this website, how it is used, and the third parties involved. Sunbeam
          Consulting is a solo AI strategy and fractional leadership practice run by
          Diana Pfeil. If you have any questions, email
          <a href="mailto:diana@sunbeams.ai" class="text-sunbeam-700 hover:text-sunbeam-500 underline">diana@sunbeams.ai</a>.
        </p>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Analytics (no cookies)</h2>
          <p>
            This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand basic, aggregate
            traffic patterns such as page views, referring sites, and general
            location and device type. Cloudflare Web Analytics does not use cookies,
            does not fingerprint visitors, and does not build profiles of individual
            people or track you across other websites. The data is anonymous and
            aggregated.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Contact form</h2>
          <p>
            If you submit the contact form, your message and the details you provide
            (such as your name and email address) are delivered to us through
            Formspree, a form-handling service. We use this information only to
            respond to your inquiry. Formspree processes the submission on our
            behalf; see Formspree's own privacy policy for details on their handling.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Scheduling</h2>
          <p>
            Our contact page links to a scheduling tool provided by Reclaim.ai. If
            you book a call, any information you enter is handled by Reclaim.ai under
            their privacy policy. We use it only to schedule and prepare for our
            conversation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Fonts</h2>
          <p>
            This site loads the Inter typeface from Google Fonts. When your browser
            requests the font files, your IP address is shared with Google as part of
            that request. We do not use Google Fonts for tracking.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Hosting</h2>
          <p>
            This site is hosted on GitHub Pages. Like most web hosts, GitHub may keep
            standard server logs (including IP addresses) for security and
            operational purposes under GitHub's privacy practices.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">What we do not do</h2>
          <p>
            We do not use advertising cookies, we do not run third-party ad networks,
            and we do not sell or share your personal information for advertising. We
            collect only what is described above.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Your choices and contact</h2>
          <p>
            If you would like to ask about, access, or delete any information you have
            shared with us (for example, a contact form submission), email
            <a href="mailto:diana@sunbeams.ai" class="text-sunbeam-700 hover:text-sunbeam-500 underline">diana@sunbeams.ai</a>
            and we will respond. We may update this policy from time to time; the
            effective date above reflects the latest version.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
